0..76 Comment "// The constants of the block `Llvm` of `std.llvm` are closed terms of their"
77..86 Comment "// sorts."
87..89 Comment "//"
90..165 Comment "// `Terms Llvm Ty` is the type of the closed terms of the sort `Ty`, so the"
166..244 Comment "// constant `int8` is a value of it. A function reads such a term by a `match`"
245..277 Comment "// on the constants of its sort."
278..280 Comment "//"
281..358 Comment "// Limits: a term of the sort `Body` or of the sort `Val` is not a value of a"
359..436 Comment "// type of the tree. Each operation of a body binds the rest of the body at a"
437..501 Comment "// port of `Val`, and the type of such terms is refused (#4150)."
502..504 Comment "//"
505..566 Comment "// - see: `../../../library/std/src/llvm.gandr` — the block"
